{"task_id": "Mbpp/9", "solution": "def find_Rotations(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the minimum rotations (greater than 0) to return a string to its original form.\"\"\"\n    rotations = 0\n    original_s = s\n    current_s = s\n\n    # Iterate up to the string's length, performing rotations and checking for a match.\n    for _ in range(len(s)):\n        # Rotate the string by moving its first character to the end.\n        current_s = current_s[1:] + current_s[0]\n        # Increment the rotation counter.\n        rotations += 1\n        # If the current string matches the original, return the rotation count.\n        if current_s == original_s:\n            return rotations"}
