{"task_id": "Mbpp/16", "solution": "import re\ndef text_lowercase_underscore(input_string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Validates if the input string consists of one or more lowercase letter sequences\n    joined by underscores. Returns True if it matches, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Pattern: start, one+ lowercase, then zero+ (underscore + one+ lowercase), end.\n    pattern = r\"^[a-z]+(_[a-z]+)*$\"\n\n    # re.match() checks for a match only at the beginning of the string.\n    # Since our pattern uses ^ and $, it ensures the entire string matches.\n    return re.match(pattern, input_string) is not None"}
