{"task_id": "Mbpp/67", "solution": "def _combinations(n, k):\n    \"\"\"Calculates n choose k (binomial coefficient).\"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        res = res * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n    return res\ndef bell_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Bell number using a dynamic programming approach.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    bell = [0] * (n + 1)\n    bell[0] = 1\n\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        current_bell_number = 0\n        for k in range(i):\n            current_bell_number += _combinations(i - 1, k) * bell[k]\n        bell[i] = current_bell_number\n\n    return bell[n]"}
