{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(elements):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list using the comb sort algorithm with a gap factor of 1.3.\n    The sorting is performed in-place.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(elements)\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n    gap_factor = 1.3\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        # Calculate the new gap\n        gap = int(gap / gap_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        # Perform a single pass with the current gap\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if elements[i] > elements[i + gap]:\n                elements[i], elements[i + gap] = elements[i + gap], elements[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return elements"}
