{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of elements using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    Returns a new, sorted list without modifying the original.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    working_list = list(input_list)  # Create a mutable copy of the input list.\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        # Calculate the new gap value.\n        gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        # Perform a modified bubble sort for the current gap.\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if working_list[i] > working_list[i + gap]:\n                working_list[i], working_list[i + gap] = working_list[i + gap], working_list[i]\n                swapped = True\n\n    return working_list"}
