{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"Splits an input list into n sublists, distributing elements at regular intervals.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n\n    # Initialize n empty sublists.\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    # Distribute elements from the input_list into the sublists.\n    for i, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        result[i % n].append(element)\n\n    return result"}
