{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n-th Lucas number using an iterative approach.\n    It follows L(0)=2, L(1)=1, and L(n) = L(n-1) + L(n-2) for n > 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        l0, l1 = 2, 1\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n            next_lucas = l0 + l1\n            l0 = l1\n            l1 = next_lucas\n        return l1"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/388", "solution": "def highest_Power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the largest power of 2 less than or equal to n.\n    It iteratively doubles a power of 2 until the next power exceeds n.\"\"\"\n\n    power = 1\n    # Iteratively double 'power' while the next power is less than or equal to n.\n    while (power << 1) <= n:\n        power <<= 1\n    return power"}
