{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "from typing import List, Dict, Any\ndef convert_list_dictionary(primary_keys: List, secondary_keys: List, values: List) -> List[Dict[Any, Dict[Any, Any]]]:\n    \"\"\"Converts three input lists into a structured list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each element in the output list is a dictionary mapping a primary key to a nested dictionary.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_list = []\n    # Iterate through the input lists simultaneously using their indices to preserve order.\n    for i in range(len(primary_keys)):\n        primary_key = primary_keys[i]\n        secondary_key = secondary_keys[i]\n        value = values[i]\n\n        # Create the nested dictionary: {secondary_key: value}\n        nested_dict = {secondary_key: value}\n\n        # Create the outer dictionary: {primary_key: nested_dict}\n        output_dict = {primary_key: nested_dict}\n\n        # Add the constructed dictionary to the results list\n        result_list.append(output_dict)\n\n    return result_list"}
