{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "_memo: dict[int, int] = {}\ndef get_max_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the maximum sum for a given integer n using a recursive equation with memoization.\"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    sum_of_parts = (\n        get_max_sum(n // 2) +\n        get_max_sum(n // 3) +\n        get_max_sum(n // 4) +\n        get_max_sum(n // 5)\n    )\n\n    result = max(sum_of_parts, n)\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
