{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts an array using the Shell sort algorithm.\n    This sort is an in-place comparison sort that can be seen as a generalization of insertion sort.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    gap = n // 2\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = arr[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and arr[j - gap] > temp:\n                arr[j] = arr[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            arr[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return arr"}
