{"task_id": "Mbpp/440", "solution": "import spacy\n_nlp_model = None\ndef find_adverb_position(sentence: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies the first adverb in a sentence and returns its position and text.\n    Returns (start_index, end_index, adverb_string) or None if no adverb is found.\n    \"\"\"\n    _load_nlp_model()\n    doc = _nlp_model(sentence)\n\n    for token in doc:\n        if token.pos_ == 'ADV':\n            start_index = token.idx\n            end_index = token.idx + len(token.text)\n            adverb_string = token.text\n            return (start_index, end_index, adverb_string)\n\n    return None"}
