{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    This function internally uses a helper to generate Perrin numbers with memoization.\n    \"\"\"\n    _perrin_cache = {}\n\n    def _get_perrin(k: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Retrieves or calculates the Perrin number P(k), utilizing memoization.\n        Handles base cases P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2, and recursion P(k) = P(k-2) + P(k-3) for k > 2.\n        \"\"\"\n        if k in _perrin_cache:\n            return _perrin_cache[k]\n\n        if k == 0:\n            val = 3\n        elif k == 1:\n            val = 0\n        elif k == 2:\n            val = 2\n        else:  # k > 2\n            val = _get_perrin(k - 2) + _get_perrin(k - 3)\n\n        _perrin_cache[k] = val\n        return val\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _get_perrin(k)\n\n    return total_sum"}
