{"task_id": "Mbpp/589", "solution": "def perfect_squares(start: int, end: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds all perfect squares within the inclusive range [start, end].\n    Returns a list of perfect squares in ascending order.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    i = 1\n    while True:\n        square = i * i\n        if square > end:\n            break\n        if square >= start:\n            result.append(square)\n        i += 1\n    return result"}
