{"task_id": "Mbpp/619", "solution": "def move_num(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Moves all numeric characters to the end of the string, preserving relative order.\"\"\"\n    non_numeric_chars_list = []\n    numeric_chars_list = []\n\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char.isdecimal():\n            numeric_chars_list.append(char)\n        else:\n            non_numeric_chars_list.append(char)\n\n    non_numeric_string = \"\".join(non_numeric_chars_list)\n    numeric_string = \"\".join(numeric_chars_list)\n\n    return non_numeric_string + numeric_string"}
