{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(arr: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of bitwise XOR operations for all unique pairs in a list.\n    It iterates through all distinct pairs (arr[i], arr[j]) and sums their XOR results.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            pair_xor = arr[i] ^ arr[j]\n            total_xor_sum += pair_xor\n\n    return total_xor_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers: list, count: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XOR of all unique pairs in a given list of numbers.\n    It iterates through all unique pairs (i, j) where i < j.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    for i in range(count):\n        for j in range(i + 1, count):\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n    return total_xor_sum"}
