{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses the order of elements in the input array from the beginning up to the k-th position (inclusive).\n    Handles k <= 0 by returning arr, and k >= len(arr) by reversing the entire array.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr or k <= 0:\n        return arr\n\n    effective_end_index = min(k, len(arr))\n\n    left = 0\n    right = effective_end_index - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        arr[left], arr[right] = arr[right], arr[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n\n    return arr"}
