{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "import math\ndef lateralsurface_cone(r: float, h: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the lateral surface area of a cone given its radius and height.\n    This function uses the formula pi * r * l, where l is the slant height.\"\"\"\n\n    # Calculate the slant height (l)\n    l = math.sqrt(r**2 + h**2)\n\n    # Calculate the lateral surface area\n    area = math.pi * r * l\n\n    return area"}
