{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(sorted_array: list, element: any) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the index of the last occurrence of an element in a sorted array.\n    Returns -1 if the element is not found or the array is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sorted_array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sorted_array[mid] == element:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1  # Search in the right half for a later occurrence\n        elif sorted_array[mid] < element:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result"}
